 , human-AI interaction\, and institutional practice. Technical work is re
 levant through a serious ethical or societal contribution.\nAdditional to
 pics: Human-AI Interaction & Deployment\, Privacy-preserving ML\nScope so
 urces (2026): https://www.aies-conference.com/2026/call-for-papers/\nScop
 e last checked: 2026-10-07
